[{"client_msg_id":"e8f7fe87-c3ac-4df9-ace4-f73256d42ccb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Shougoさんが使っているというイメージが強い\n別にそれだけではないのだけど","ts":"1634654180.073000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7OR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9a090c8-2e4b-4fe9-9708-d89bea8dcf1c","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"こんな感じで開けそうですね","ts":"1634654179.072800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nxf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c52e697b-3c03-4a8c-af41-b8614750e0b1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"```nvim.command('new')```","ts":"1634654173.072500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lQox"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f714f70-e1ab-48de-91c7-94dee7e75c1a","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/pynvim\u003e\nneovimか","ts":"1634654134.072100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"neovim/pynvim","id":1,"title":"neovim/pynvim","text":"Python client and plugin host for Nvim","fields":[{"title":"Website","value":"\u003chttp://pynvim.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\u003e","short":true},{"title":"Stars","value":"935","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i9="}]},{"client_msg_id":"8be5e067-8421-4f6b-93d0-47c7f54c89f5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ただしポップアップはウィンドウなので、戻り値を得て、適切なタイミングで閉じるコードも必要ですね。","ts":"1634653768.071800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+qh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5c2eb17-4b39-48ad-8838-d0a8b95e7b21","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"fzf と同じにしたいならゴリラさんの言う様に popup の方がいいです。","ts":"1634653738.071100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jo3n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7eddd1cb-ac44-4be2-af39-94d7a8d2829a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"だれもpynvimの実例を知らないので、そこは調べるしかなさそうな感じもあるけど...","ts":"1634653635.070700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DM1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cf35c65-d2a8-434f-a231-359bd949ba57","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"皆さんお答えいただきありがとうございます。\n返信を見させていただきました。\npynvimで新しいバッファを開く処理を書くときは、\nバッファを開くexコマンドをpynvimから呼び出せば実現できるということでしょうか？","ts":"1634653231.069900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cNvP5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98633f01-96f9-4b7c-a5c1-8303fb6af1ff","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"fzf.vimは確か、popup window/floating windowを使っているのでVimなら↓ウィンドウ出せると思います\n```:call popup_create(systemlist(\"...\"))```","ts":"1634649864.067900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p85"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a51a8751-a222-4650-bc00-73501e363163","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"2つと言いながら3つ書くメソッド。","ts":"1634649099.066300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lsY5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef6d1538-8f9b-4e71-bfea-0da38460b776","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"方法は2つ\n1. pynvim 詳しくないけどもしコマンドなのであれば `:terminal pynvim ...`\n2. もしくは `:new` したバッファで `:call setline(1, systemlist('pynvim'))`\n3. 自分で出力を加工してから表示したいのであれば\n```let l:buf = system('pynvim ...')\nlet l:buf = substitute(....)\ncall setline(1, split(l:buf, \"\\n\", 1))```","ts":"1634649089.066000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VXDT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34b603b4-9de3-4aba-81ba-6f349ad42407","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"コマンドを実行したら新しくバッファが開いて、そこに表示される様ににしたいです。","ts":"1634648790.064000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ifkM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4ec8f4c-2041-41ce-b8cb-10029ec607be","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"出力をどこに表示するんですか","ts":"1634647111.062400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qa6i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7b996eeb-ab3d-4e2f-8cc9-670c958dc836","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"＼nは効かなかったかな","ts":"1634647084.061900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iGe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d197578b-c84e-4ba4-891d-d2ff95e3a1da","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"突然の質問すみません。\n今Vimのプラグインを作っていて、pynvimで複数行の出力結果を表示したいんですがどのように書けば良いのか調べてもイマイチ良く分からなかった\nので、教えてくださると嬉しいです。\nもしよろしければfzf.vimを起動すると出てくるウィンドウの作り方もおしえてくださると幸いです。","ts":"1634646667.061400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LPEm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88123806-d270-4e38-bbe9-4a710d7b93af","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとでミニマルなサンプル作ってみるか","ts":"1634639070.056100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PXwDN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f7f79b7-04eb-44a1-92c2-3da3a0c96325","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"しかもそれがGoのexec.Command.Runからerrorとして見えない、って状況。","ts":"1634639042.055900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2FHs8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9ee81d3-37ea-43d3-80d5-ba26f1c0c646","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"(思うところを言ってしまったけど、できる方法はわかりませぬ...、ありえるんだろうか....)","ts":"1634638895.055400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s9oGX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9677c352-e2d9-4246-8c7a-c22861ab91c5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁmsys2なWindowsでやってるからLinuxだとまた結果はちがうかもしらんけども。","ts":"1634638560.054500","thread_ts":"1634638560.054500","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zBfl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0380dd6-25da-47b8-b6b8-5a45cb0687e7","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"spawn禁止ってどうやるん?","ts":"1634638538.054000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"thinking_face","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hXXc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f652d579-e62d-4e72-8144-314944c75e03","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"無限spawn状態の遮断ができるように、spawn禁止にしてからシグナルを送るみたいな?","ts":"1634637971.053700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nlK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c41a5692-8163-4c46-8660-73be7f6f7f58","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁそうとしか考えられないか。","ts":"1634637935.053100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dign"}]},{"client_msg_id":"675d9102-1cba-41de-b730-72b3f70892ec","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"makeがやってるんか?","ts":"1634637928.052900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BOE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2dcd264-fc8a-467c-9e4c-4ae154481cd2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"つまり新たなプロセスをspawnできない状態になるんだな…","ts":"1634637913.052700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xg6on"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6fa65df-3323-4631-aa43-b0262082060a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちょっとこっちでもターゲットプログラムを調べてたんですが、ターゲットプログラムはSIGINTを受けて終了処理に入るんですが、その最中にいくつかの子プロセスを立ち上げようとするんですよね。その立ち上げがmakeのCtrl-C経由だと失敗する。というかエラーすら取れない。","ts":"1634637374.052100","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1634637852.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8EFW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6e67627-7b4e-4cac-b5d1-1fb8adb1e7e5","type":"message","user":"U02CLFXL19A","text":"|_-) .oO( makeが投げ直しているとすると、私の環境でpkillでなげたINTに無反応なのはなんでなんだろうか、という新たな疑問を抱えてしまった……。 あとで調査してみよう。 )","ts":"1634632189.050300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GBq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27b4833f-395c-4423-bf38-a99f97438b52","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ふむ。簡単なプログラムもちゃんと動いたな…となるとターゲットプログラムのほうに何か問題があるっぽい。\n\nさーせんおさわがせしました。","ts":"1634632096.049400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SzeFb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f4f82df-263f-4ea6-a3ff-f873773bb630","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとはmsys2が間に入ってなにかやってるとかいう可能性もゼロではないのかな…","ts":"1634631936.048400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ERHa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e51fcbd-277d-4555-8d13-14717312bd34","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"プラットフォームごとに分かれてるけど、大体読み替えて投げてそう。","ts":"1634631910.047900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M9i="}]},{"client_msg_id":"60e03f48-fa27-4f86-84a5-5e8159bd39c8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mirror/make/blob/c5d4b7b2f260c85ba48db4e844c4a2e4e3004238/src/commands.c#L545-L563\u003e","ts":"1634631820.047000","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/mirror/make/blob/c5d4b7b2f260c85ba48db4e844c4a2e4e3004238/src/commands.c | commands.c\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/mirror/make/blob/c5d4b7b2f260c85ba48db4e844c4a2e4e3004238/src/commands.c | commands.c\u003e","text":"```\n  /* If we got a signal that means the user\n     wanted to kill make, remove pending targets.  */\n\n  if (sig == SIGTERM || sig == SIGINT\n#ifdef SIGHUP\n    || sig == SIGHUP\n#endif\n#ifdef SIGQUIT\n    || sig == SIGQUIT\n#endif\n    )\n    {\n      struct child *c;\n\n      /* Remote children won't automatically get signals sent\n         to the process group, so we must send them.  */\n      for (c = children; c != 0; c = c-\u0026gt;next)\n        if (c-\u0026gt;remote \u0026amp;\u0026amp; c-\u0026gt;pid \u0026gt; 0)\n          (void) remote_kill (c-\u0026gt;pid, sig);\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/mirror/make|mirror/make\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1634631832.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3gf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"166a5883-8194-4a14-a1c3-21cc4859ac16","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"うーんコード見ると、シグナル投げる仕組みはあるなぁ","ts":"1634631731.046800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wMAIG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20499423-4bf6-4f75-b4d2-e52aaae5222f","type":"message","user":"U02CLFXL19A","text":"あららら？","ts":"1634631465.046100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YYh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4b38bd5-de41-4c1b-bb65-5a67c22a3f4e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ふむ /usr/bin/time 使うとmsys2 でも time が受け取ってるように見えるな…なんだこれ?","ts":"1634631440.045800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1634631494.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QcgQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b02b32a-200b-4352-9f09-5dc69585e311","type":"message","user":"U02CLFXL19A","text":"msys2のCtrl-Cがプロセスグループじゃなくて、フォアグラウンドプロセス一個にだけシグナル投げている、とかですかねぇ……。msys2ちょっと分からない……。\nLinuxのmakeの挙動を見る限りmake自体は子プロセスにシグナルを投げていなさそうなので、msys2側のシグナルの挙動の違いな気がしますが、ちょっと分からずです……。","ts":"1634631419.045300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wtt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55f28233-1f25-41eb-8008-c486bc600df5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Windowsのmsys2なんだけども、中で実行しているプログラムがシグナルをハンドルしてるんだけど、直接実行すると Ctrl-C がちゃんと取れるのに対し、make経由で実行するとトラップされてないっぽいんですよね。","ts":"1634631184.043400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CSs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"507bcb06-97dd-48c5-a724-64235726cdde","type":"message","user":"U02CLFXL19A","text":"\u0026gt; `Command terminated by signal 2`\nsleepはsignal 2を受けて死んだ\n\u0026gt; `make: *** [\u003chttp://test.mk:2|test.mk:2\u003e: test] エラー 130`\nmakeがsleep(の終了ステータスをそのままパスするtime)を終了ステータス130(128+2)で終了検知","ts":"1634631176.043200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9oU7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05d8715d-254c-4d9f-abd8-e1742e67605d","type":"message","user":"U02CLFXL19A","text":"makeはINTを受けてもなにもしない気配？\n```test:\n        /usr/bin/time -v sleep inf```\n```$ make test\n/usr/bin/time -v sleep inf```\n```$ pkill -INT make```\nなにも起きない\n\nCtrl-Cの場合はINTをプロセスグループに投げるので、子プロセス含めてみんなにSIGINTが飛んで、子プロセスが死んだ結果、makeが子プロセスの死亡を検知して終了、という流れになりそうです？\n```make test\n/usr/bin/time -v sleep inf\n^CCommand terminated by signal 2\n        Command being timed: \"sleep inf\"\n        User time (seconds): 0.00\n        System time (seconds): 0.00\n        Percent of CPU this job got: 0%\n        Elapsed (wall clock) time (h:mm:ss or m:ss): 3:42.67\n        Average shared text size (kbytes): 0\n        Average unshared data size (kbytes): 0\n        Average stack size (kbytes): 0\n        Average total size (kbytes): 0\n        Maximum resident set size (kbytes): 1972\n        Average resident set size (kbytes): 0\n        Major (requiring I/O) page faults: 0\n        Minor (reclaiming a frame) page faults: 84\n        Voluntary context switches: 2\n        Involuntary context switches: 0\n        Swaps: 0\n        File system inputs: 0\n        File system outputs: 0\n        Socket messages sent: 0\n        Socket messages received: 0\n        Signals delivered: 0\n        Page size (bytes): 4096\n        Exit status: 0\nmake: *** [\u003chttp://test.mk:2|test.mk:2\u003e: test] エラー 130```","ts":"1634631074.040200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yZ+D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95065bec-b200-44ac-896c-e45198355781","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"make って sigint 受けたとき、子プロセスに何送るんや? sigkill?","ts":"1634630513.037700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ysv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cf8ceea-582c-4ee8-b6cc-5ca34576b3f3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ということで \u003c#C011WE9V2R1|os-windows\u003e へ","ts":"1634656880.079900","thread_ts":"1634638560.054500","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fbsH7"}]}]
